window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>There's a reason they're called Inferno Force. </b><br> <b>Three more sizzling romances. Three fiery heroines. Three warriors who won't know what hit them.</b></p> <p>Whether it's fake boyfriends, stolen identities, or family claims, these human women aren't backing down from the challenges—or the smoking-hot aliens who complicate everything.</p> <p><b>BLAZE:</b> When an unwanted pursuer crashes her cousin's wedding, Layne ropes a notorious Drexian warrior into playing her fake boyfriend. But being stranded on a space station means their pretend romance might become all too real—even if he's the last warrior she'd ever expect to settle down.</p> <p><b>FLAME:</b> She wasn't supposed to be the tribute bride, but when her perfect twin sister is abducted, guilt drives her to stow away on a rescue mission. Crashing on an alien planet with her sister's gorgeous, infuriating fiancé wasn't part of the plan—and neither was the undeniable attraction between them.</p> <p><b>COMBUST:</b> After Noora's wedding falls through, she's ready to head home. That is, until her fiancé's uncle claims her as his. Taken to the Drexian Academy with him, she must navigate schemes and plots while trying to resist the intense, brooding alien who now owns her heart—whether she wants him to or not.</p> <p>This three-book collection features smoking-hot Inferno Force warriors, including a silver fox who knows exactly what he wants, fake relationships that become real, and three guaranteed HEAs. If you like feisty heroines, aliens with extra erogenous zones, and lots of adventure, you'll love books 4-6 in Tana Stone's sci-fi romance Inferno Force of the Drexian Warriors series.</p>"; 
